1
00:04:18,947 --> 00:04:24,947
A new ice age apocalypse.

2
00:08:37,894 --> 00:08:43,894
Ice Storm is a science fiction, action, horror film directed by Jared Cohn.

3
00:12:56,842 --> 00:13:02,842
When a devastating winter storm freezes over the whole of North Carolina, climatologists and
disaster relief experts are called in before the entire East Coast is destroyed.

4
00:17:15,789 --> 00:17:21,789
Molly, played by McKenzie Westmore.

5
00:21:34,736 --> 00:21:40,736
Eric, played by Grant Bowler.

6
00:25:53,684 --> 00:25:59,684
Griffin, played by Tyler Christopher.

7
00:30:12,631 --> 00:30:18,631
Senator Carlson, played by William Baldwin.

8
00:34:31,578 --> 00:34:37,578
Chrissy, played by Tori Griffith.

9
00:38:50,526 --> 00:38:56,526
Clay, played by Jessie B. Evans.

10
00:43:09,473 --> 00:43:15,473
The Ice Storm is a 1997 American drama film directed by Ang Lee and written by
James Schamus adapting the 1994 novel The Ice Storm by Rick Moody.

11
00:47:28,421 --> 00:47:34,421
During Thanksgiving in 1973, two neighboring suburban families seek escape from
their emotional emptiness through infidelity and self-indulgence.

12
00:51:47,368 --> 00:51:53,368
The film stars Kevin Kline, Joan Allen, Tobey Maguire, Christina Ricci, Elijah Wood,
Katie Holmes, Glenn Fitzgerald, Jamey Sheridan, and Sigourney Weaver.

13
00:56:06,315 --> 00:56:12,315
The film was produced by Fox Searchlight Pictures on a budget of $18 million.

14
01:00:25,263 --> 01:00:31,263
The film premiered on May 12, 1997, at the 1997 Cannes Film Festival, where
Schamus won the Cannes Film Festival Award for Best Screenplay.

15
01:04:44,210 --> 01:04:50,210
Fox Searchlight gave the film a limited theatrical release
in the United States on September 27, 1997.

16
01:09:03,157 --> 01:09:09,157
It grossed $8 million in the U.S., and it grossed $8 million
outside the US for a worldwide total of $16 million.

17
01:13:22,105 --> 01:13:28,105
Among other accolades, Weaver won the BAFTA Award for
Best Actress in a Supporting Role.

18
01:17:41,052 --> 01:17:47,052
The tone is dark and thought_provoking.
